msgid "LightWare SF40/C 360 Lidar"
msgstr "LightWare SF40/C 360 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:7
#: 50e5105e03014641abb6e06d1c8e64d8 576bfcc47eae453a8306905daea2f65d
#: 740f5e9fa1de47699711969613d80256 911916fc8fbf4d89a5c3c0894f8a4b6f
#: f5f91280f5ec41b4abe463b8ebc987c9
msgid ""
"The `Lightware SF40/C 360degree lidar "
"<https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/sf40-c-100-m>`__ can be used for Object Avoidance in "
"Copter-3.4 and higher in Loiter mode."
msgstr ""
"`Lightware SF40/C 360 度激光雷达 <https://lightware.co.za/collections/lidar-"
"rangefinders/products/sf40-c-100-m>`__ 可用于 Copter-3.4 及更高版本的 Loiter 模式避障。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:11
#: 24c18397de08494bba94d35ca3f4808f 6206b58d010640cea6dc612ff1fbf4a7
#: ba3ff0b6866543248bd191c19338961d be908780eb2146d0a56bd2614509f2ac
#: e44d6c53d26a4aeaa59f5da792919ebc
msgid ""
"This feature has not been tested in a wide variety of situations and should "
"be used with caution."
msgstr "该功能尚未在多种情况下进行测试，使用时请谨慎。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:17
#: 095a79a61b894b678e4c6b55b1047154 21234e7e4ad04af395945c30d5a6223c
#: c0a18ea1c2e14159908b6537f6e8d90c c436ca65b75b4a159c10f4bbcfcc17d6
#: e0109d4af12049dfb57387d85c0e8a67
msgid "Mounting the SF40c"
msgstr "安装 SF40c"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:23
#: 091822d1401d4e85b81f4c2998d79399 2ac78f6bd4f54e22929db8b837d82644
#: 2f44b2a05eca41b18885baa3fadb9584 74e2dfed7e16451d82103200b78ac4b9
#: f751aff031134ada80b41ffe1c328dda
msgid ""
"The SF40c should be mounted on the top or bottom of the vehicle so that the "
"rotating portion scans horizontally and its view is not obstructed by any "
"portion of the vehicle including GPS mast, vehicle legs etc.  The round gold"
" and black lightware logo should be facing forward."
msgstr ""
"SF40c 应安装在飞行器顶部或底部，使旋转部分水平扫描，且视野不被飞行器任何部分遮挡，包括 GPS 桅杆、飞行器支腿等。圆形金黑色 Lightware"
" 标志应朝向前方。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:26
#: 1238462c0fd948a6b9b62a3f596aa088 1e8abc4c901f4b84b1a8c7179fba68c1
#: 3f601da439484e33a70798fd0435920f 614bd1e3484d4e998140cac9a812301c
#: 72d204d0a8f6429fb554eac02717efcd
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:31
#: 01b20ef9225f4fcabbb95b4b215dcfde 365410206ed149dbae2cfde8ebee07a1
#: 686fa69d54ce4358a2fac44b28bae0c1 75e1b4f2a5c5470581b721f888a548ba
#: 79d82b96829b41be8dd800ca186719a3
msgid ""
"The diagram above shows how the SF40c can be connected to the autopilot's "
"serial input.  The above pictures shows use of Serial4 but any free serial "
"port can be used."
msgstr "上图显示了 SF40c 如何连接到飞控的串口输入。上图使用 Serial4，但任何空闲串口均可使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:34
#: 41df1acda3804315ba63b3a75e0d0cfb 6f68f3c226b9406cbb0e78a280704d66
#: af082994f52d41cba21f4c1a20c72d33 bb4458762c0d42d987105e4d4821b1d9
#: f11835561112405cb4bccb003a4fe6da
msgid "Configuration through the Ground Station"
msgstr "通过地面站配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:35
#: 2609048e532e446780c84579609702d7 52d03305c942472cb18a16765ab10690
#: 6eed4c2010b14638a564190e6c56cd3b e817c5a8ada9467485dc7b2fdf5a9895
#: f7f9f7aab339459fb540388307731449
msgid "Example setup below shown for first proximity sensor:"
msgstr "以下为第一个近距传感器的设置示例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:37
#: 1089fb6966924f51bbbae696a2bac6bc 4bebb3ea4b984b629e879b4503990213
#: 8da1ef8ac67c430fb03daf9fe1fcd5e0 a3f773eb403d47c987e8a8791b6a3501
#: c571e6b70c2040368311452db18c47a9
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = \"11\" (\"Lidar360\") if using "
"Serial4."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL <SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 「11」（「Lidar360」），使用 Serial4 "
"时设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:38
#: 1cf7e295952f4ffb8332f48bb1fb846d 39496dd7889147318dbd10d8e2f1e25a
#: 62047f2c5c9f4a869f6273f02c5fbe53 77b44a4daa43452b810d1395b5155857
#: 8b1468f28f0949afb52ce75d4b2e2344
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` =  \"921\" if using Serial4."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_BAUD <SERIAL4_BAUD>` = 「921」，使用 Serial4 时设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:39
#: 2872c0174b1e494c889adc41be8a9433 41becd3ce5f648fd93761be154de3f87
#: 422df5ee07764dd4b381590eb1bf0844 8bed1c74ef3e47648cd73b3f1f88a799
#: ecba7b80ba91419f9bad77e577c62c4e
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = \"7\" (LightwareSF40c) or \"1\" "
"(LightwareSF40C-legacy) if using a very old version of the sensor"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_TYPE <PRX1_TYPE>` = 「7」（LightwareSF40c），或 "
"「1」（LightwareSF40C-legacy），如果使用非常旧的传感器版本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:40
#: 1087417032d14909a51423a89cd635c7 1d0022999e1b4fb9a9a649d28f9cec53
#: 5aa8cf54ff0c44c0b9c2a3693057a5d7 8f530ebe833349d3aed1e60778e9a1e2
#: f20f5e0348734fe294c9f9fbe4c1a358
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = \"0\" if mounted on the top of the "
"vehicle, \"1\" if mounted upside-down on the bottom of the vehicle."
msgstr ":ref:`PRX1_ORIENT <PRX1_ORIENT>` = 「0」，如果安装在飞行器顶部；「1」，如果倒置安装在飞行器底部。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:41
#: 01323de020af4e65be4e88c69938b249 3fcd04b629f6492a95a69bbc2cb30612
#: 67f60b2100254cbebf9efe3d22293eb2 aae4bbe5329f4b2e95695e9577839b6e
#: e0305e793bb0453ba2bb598c25f4054c
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` allows adjusting the forward direction "
"of the SF40c.  One way to determine this angle is to use the Mission "
"Planner's Setup >> Advanced, Proximity viewer and then walk around the "
"vehicle and ensure that the sector distances shorten appropriately."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_YAW_CORR <PRX1_YAW_CORR>` 允许调整 SF40c 的前向方向。确定此角度的一种方法是使用 Mission "
"Planner 的设置 >> 高级，近距查看器，然后绕飞行器行走，确保扇区距离适当缩短。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:42
#: 05766b307adb45fca0fa75cc70cc9e2b 546a7416da4b4a31b629a7dfccfb2975
#: 725f5c5ae8454ae79478ac5f862d08a8 dcbbc36a37af4e3092235428fe944259
#: ffc23e612d6e491bb58db0e8f8af1b29
msgid ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` and :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 "
"<PRX1_IGN_WID1>` parameters allow defining zones around the vehicle that "
"should be ignored.  For example to avoid a 20deg area behind the vehicle, "
"set :ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` to 180 and :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 "
"<PRX1_IGN_WID1>` to 20."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>` 和 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 <PRX1_IGN_WID1>` "
"参数允许定义应被忽略的飞行器周围区域。例如，要忽略飞行器后方 20 度区域，将 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_ANG1 <PRX1_IGN_ANG1>`"
" 设为 180，将 :ref:`PRX1_IGN_WID1 <PRX1_IGN_WID1>` 设为 20。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-lightware-sf40c-objectavoidance.rst:44
#: 01ddc5babca242aea0b58c05c51cabfb 08f2f52555934bd9b95a72e189298d25
#: 10221add77264a1b8f6b02a3aef1d5d9 1a9758d505f84799a22ef0237edc9f3d
#: 507c33629df5417b82a4bf1898335838
msgid ""
"More details on using this sensor for object avoidance on Copter can be "
"found :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"有关在 Copter 上使用此传感器进行避障的更多详情，请参阅 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>`。"
